{"3645100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Grenouilles 3D", "steam_appid": 3645100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645100/extras/e5f65ea408b8f63902edc70ff53d5f3b.poster.avif?t=1780234084\" width=466 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645100/extras/e5f65ea408b8f63902edc70ff53d5f3b.webm?t=1780234084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645100/extras/e5f65ea408b8f63902edc70ff53d5f3b.mp4?t=1780234084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grenouilles 3D is a multiplayer co-op hopping game where you play as a climbing.. or falling frog. Escape your polluted pond and try to find a more suitable place to live. With a mouse only control scheme, team up with your colorful friends and see who's the best grenouille!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EASIER TOGETHER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember that falling is only an excuse to spend more time with your friends. And when it gets hard, you know who you can count on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645100/extras/c5c19d3537fa7af9ebbfc0ef32ee60c4.poster.avif?t=1780234084\" width=468 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645100/extras/c5c19d3537fa7af9ebbfc0ef32ee60c4.webm?t=1780234084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645100/extras/c5c19d3537fa7af9ebbfc0ef32ee60c4.mp4?t=1780234084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZATION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your frog stand out by choosing from various stylish colors and hats. The NPCs will even tell you how beautiful you are!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645100/extras/e850d6dc8a380be3c50eda917ff5dd41.poster.avif?t=1780234084\" width=468 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645100/extras/e850d6dc8a380be3c50eda917ff5dd41.webm?t=1780234084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645100/extras/e850d6dc8a380be3c50eda917ff5dd41.mp4?t=1780234084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VERTICAL ADVENTURE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit 7 different environments each bringing their own challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645100/extras/02847b68917278d8628948ee1ff24f5c.poster.avif?t=1780234084\" width=468 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645100/extras/02847b68917278d8628948ee1ff24f5c.webm?t=1780234084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645100/extras/02847b68917278d8628948ee1ff24f5c.mp4?t=1780234084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to 6 friends !</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse only</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 different levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat bubbles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two fish!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frog customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weird flying creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 reoccurring NPCs<br><br><br><br>game page art by @sketchiz_by_alice</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645100/extras/e5f65ea408b8f63902edc70ff53d5f3b.poster.avif?t=1780234084\" width=466 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645100/extras/e5f65ea408b8f63902edc70ff53d5f3b.webm?t=1780234084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645100/extras/e5f65ea408b8f63902edc70ff53d5f3b.mp4?t=1780234084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grenouilles 3D is a multiplayer co-op hopping game where you play as a climbing.. or falling frog. Escape your polluted pond and try to find a more suitable place to live. With a mouse only control scheme, team up with your colorful friends and see who's the best grenouille!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EASIER TOGETHER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember that falling is only an excuse to spend more time with your friends. And when it gets hard, you know who you can count on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645100/extras/c5c19d3537fa7af9ebbfc0ef32ee60c4.poster.avif?t=1780234084\" width=468 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645100/extras/c5c19d3537fa7af9ebbfc0ef32ee60c4.webm?t=1780234084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645100/extras/c5c19d3537fa7af9ebbfc0ef32ee60c4.mp4?t=1780234084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZATION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your frog stand out by choosing from various stylish colors and hats. The NPCs will even tell you how beautiful you are!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645100/extras/e850d6dc8a380be3c50eda917ff5dd41.poster.avif?t=1780234084\" width=468 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645100/extras/e850d6dc8a380be3c50eda917ff5dd41.webm?t=1780234084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645100/extras/e850d6dc8a380be3c50eda917ff5dd41.mp4?t=1780234084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VERTICAL ADVENTURE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit 7 different environments each bringing their own challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645100/extras/02847b68917278d8628948ee1ff24f5c.poster.avif?t=1780234084\" width=468 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645100/extras/02847b68917278d8628948ee1ff24f5c.webm?t=1780234084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645100/extras/02847b68917278d8628948ee1ff24f5c.mp4?t=1780234084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to 6 friends !</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse only</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 different levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat bubbles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two fish!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frog customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weird flying creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 reoccurring NPCs<br><br><br><br>game page art by @sketchiz_by_alice</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Grenouilles 3D is a multiplayer co-hopping game. Hop your way out of polluted ponds and try to find a more suitable place to live. With a unique mouse only control scheme, alone or with your colorful friends hop to the top!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645100/5be55147e9a09ee1855013bfcac4bb3484d09028/header.jpg?t=1780234084", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645100/91c6f8862e3bd6b6c219b01b7afd064e24b7a80d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780234084", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645100/91c6f8862e3bd6b6c219b01b7afd064e24b7a80d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780234084", "website": "https://cumulet.games/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 Ti / AMD Radeon R7 360 (2GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Interne